1
00:01:37,808 --> 00:01:40,711
Dear, would you answer the phone?

2
00:01:40,911 --> 00:01:41,745
Okay.

3
00:01:45,148 --> 00:01:46,416
Hello, this is Ohara.

4
00:01:46,616 --> 00:01:48,652
&lt;i&gt;Hello, my name is Kakuta.&lt;/i&gt;

5
00:01:48,985 --> 00:01:51,088
&lt;i&gt;Oh, is that you, Father? Is Hiromi-san—&lt;/i&gt;

6
00:01:51,288 --> 00:01:52,155
You again!

7
00:01:52,355 --> 00:01:54,925
I never said you could call me Father!

8
00:01:55,125 --> 00:01:55,926
&lt;i&gt;But Fa&lt;/i&gt;—

9
00:01:57,127 --> 00:01:58,128
Utterly unpleasant!

10
00:01:58,328 --> 00:02:00,931
Dad, was that call from Hideo-san?

11
00:02:01,131 --> 00:02:04,301
Yes, he suddenly called me Father, so I hung up.

12
00:02:04,501 --> 00:02:05,168
That's awful!

13
00:02:05,368 --> 00:02:08,271
Even if you're my dad, that's just too much!

14
00:02:08,605 --> 00:02:11,775
Hideo-san was calling from America, where he's staying on business!

15
00:02:11,975 --> 00:02:13,677
That's none of my concern.

16
00:02:14,077 --> 00:02:14,945
Dad...

17
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:23,653
When he's back from America, we have something important to tell you.

18
00:02:25,188 --> 00:02:27,691
Uh-oh, looks like I've caught a cold. I'm going to bed.

19
00:02:27,924 --> 00:02:28,558
Dad!

20
00:02:29,826 --> 00:02:33,530
This is bad. I'm feverish. Definitely a cold.

21
00:02:35,398 --> 00:02:38,368
What lovely wedding dresses!

22
00:02:40,003 --> 00:02:40,871
Hey, Reiko.

23
00:02:41,104 --> 00:02:42,372
What is it? Huh?

24
00:02:43,774 --> 00:02:45,542
W-What are you doing, Ryo-chan?

25
00:02:45,776 --> 00:02:48,145
My pants ripped in the back. Stitch them up.

26
00:02:48,345 --> 00:02:49,412
Ugh!

27
00:02:49,646 --> 00:02:51,047
You ruined the mood!

28
00:02:55,418 --> 00:02:58,155
Oh, you're good at sewing too, Reiko-san.

29
00:02:58,355 --> 00:03:00,957
Whoever marries you will be happy.

30
00:03:02,859 --> 00:03:04,661
Is that why you were looking at this?

31
00:03:05,128 --> 00:03:08,965
No way. Every girl loves wedding dresses.

32
00:03:09,166 --> 00:03:12,269
Rather than me, why don't you get married soon, Ryo-chan?

33
00:03:12,502 --> 00:03:15,672
No thanks! It's only good at the beginning.

34
00:03:16,006 --> 00:03:18,708
I'm enjoying my single life!

35
00:03:19,209 --> 00:03:23,146
But when I look at you, it seems more tragic than enjoyable...

36
00:03:23,346 --> 00:03:26,516
The question is if anyone would actually marry him, isn't it?

37
00:03:26,716 --> 00:03:28,285
Poor guy, but it's true.

38
00:03:28,518 --> 00:03:31,388
Hey, shut up! Mind your own business!

39
00:03:34,457 --> 00:03:37,160
Uh-oh. Work, work.

40
00:03:40,764 --> 00:03:42,165
All done here.

41
00:03:44,835 --> 00:03:46,269
Good work, everyone.

42
00:03:46,469 --> 00:03:48,772
I'm going to stop by HQ before heading home.

43
00:03:49,306 --> 00:03:51,208
I'll leave the rest to you, Nakagawa.

44
00:03:51,408 --> 00:03:52,042
Yes, sir!

45
00:03:52,242 --> 00:03:53,276
Thank you for today.

46
00:03:53,476 --> 00:03:55,545
Mmm, I'll go home and relax.

47
00:03:55,745 --> 00:03:56,479
Good evening.

48
00:03:56,713 --> 00:03:57,314
Huh?

49
00:03:58,014 --> 00:03:59,449
Oh, Hiromi-san!

50
00:03:59,783 --> 00:04:01,017
It's been a while.

51
00:04:01,384 --> 00:04:05,455
Well, well, did you come all the way here to pick up the chief? Oh?

52
00:04:07,090 --> 00:04:07,791
Hello.

53
00:04:09,192 --> 00:04:11,094
What? Chief?

54
00:04:11,761 --> 00:04:13,563
Chief, where are you?

55
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:15,098
Chief!

56
00:04:18,668 --> 00:04:20,804
Oh, you're here, Chief.

57
00:04:21,037 --> 00:04:25,442
Dad, we'd like to tell you something important over dinner.

58
00:04:25,642 --> 00:04:28,445
I can't. I still have work to do.

59
00:04:28,812 --> 00:04:30,213
Dad, please...

60
00:04:30,413 --> 00:04:31,615
It can't be helped!

61
00:04:32,048 --> 00:04:33,984
My work is important, too.

62
00:04:34,584 --> 00:04:37,888
Chief, you just said you were going home.

63
00:04:38,088 --> 00:04:39,356
I changed my mind!

64
00:04:39,589 --> 00:04:40,824
Well, that's weird.

65
00:04:41,057 --> 00:04:44,261
Your daughter came all the way here with her boyfriend.

66
00:04:44,461 --> 00:04:46,429
I got it! You're embarrassed, aren't you?

67
00:04:46,763 --> 00:04:51,301
Hiromi-san is a young lady, so I'm sure she'd rather dine with her boyfriend

68
00:04:51,501 --> 00:04:53,169
than with an old man like you.

69
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:55,939
Why not just be happy she asked, Chief?

70
00:04:56,139 --> 00:04:59,175
Daughters don't keep inviting their dads forever, you know...

71
00:04:59,676 --> 00:05:00,677
Shut up!

72
00:05:01,011 --> 00:05:03,847
It's none of your business! I'm going on patrol.

73
00:05:05,181 --> 00:05:05,815
Oh...

74
00:05:06,249 --> 00:05:06,850
Fa...

75
00:05:11,354 --> 00:05:12,355
Hideo-san.

76
00:05:15,025 --> 00:05:15,859
Hiromi-chan.

77
00:05:16,159 --> 00:05:19,996
I'm sorry. Dad wouldn't listen to me.

78
00:05:20,330 --> 00:05:21,831
We don't have time.

79
00:05:27,103 --> 00:05:30,173
Oh, you've been dating since your school days?

80
00:05:30,507 --> 00:05:31,141
Yes.

81
00:05:31,341 --> 00:05:33,810
And now you're happily engaged.

82
00:05:34,010 --> 00:05:34,878
That's great!

83
00:05:35,111 --> 00:05:36,479
Bring me another drink!

84
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,347
Coming up.

85
00:05:37,547 --> 00:05:40,283
So, what do you mean you don't have time?

86
00:05:40,483 --> 00:05:43,687
Well, Hideo-san has been asked to relocate suddenly for work.

87
00:05:43,887 --> 00:05:46,690
So I really wanted to talk to him before I go.

88
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:50,393
But Dad's being so stubborn. He won't listen to us at all.

89
00:05:50,727 --> 00:05:51,895
Hey, bring me another!

90
00:05:52,195 --> 00:05:53,029
Ryo-chan!

91
00:05:53,229 --> 00:05:55,298
The chief can be so stubborn.

92
00:05:55,498 --> 00:05:57,667
Okay. We'll give him a push, too.

93
00:05:58,034 --> 00:05:59,202
Thank you so much!

94
00:05:59,602 --> 00:06:01,071
I really appreciate it.

95
00:06:01,404 --> 00:06:03,773
Looking back, I was to blame.

96
00:06:04,074 --> 00:06:07,177
I got impatient and didn't consider her father's feelings.

97
00:06:07,577 --> 00:06:11,348
Impatient? Are you really moving that far?

98
00:06:11,548 --> 00:06:12,882
No, to Hokkaido.

99
00:06:13,083 --> 00:06:16,019
Oh, nice! The food is great, and so are the sake and beer!

100
00:06:16,219 --> 00:06:17,854
What are you talking about?

101
00:06:18,054 --> 00:06:19,589
This isn't a pleasure trip.

102
00:06:20,323 --> 00:06:23,259
R-Right. So it's more like exile from the capital, huh?

103
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:26,329
Did you mess up and have to write an apology letter?

104
00:06:26,529 --> 00:06:27,564
No, no.

105
00:06:27,764 --> 00:06:30,433
His company's head office is in Hokkaido.

106
00:06:30,633 --> 00:06:35,005
Oh, I should have mentioned this earlier. I work for this company.

107
00:06:35,205 --> 00:06:37,440
What? Then, it's a promotion, isn't it?

108
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:38,274
Oh!

109
00:06:38,875 --> 00:06:39,576
Here you are.

110
00:06:39,776 --> 00:06:42,479
Oh, software development for video games?

111
00:06:42,912 --> 00:06:46,416
Since joining, I've gone back and forth between the U.S. and Japan.

112
00:06:46,616 --> 00:06:49,619
Just when I thought I could settle down, I'm sent to Hokkaido.

113
00:06:49,819 --> 00:06:51,588
I can't do anything for Hiromi-chan.

114
00:06:51,788 --> 00:06:53,757
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

115
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:55,592
I'm fine!

116
00:06:55,792 --> 00:06:58,795
Even if we have to be apart for a while, I'm very happy!

117
00:06:59,262 --> 00:07:00,096
Hiromi-chan.

118
00:07:00,296 --> 00:07:02,065
Hey! Hey, hey!

119
00:07:02,632 --> 00:07:03,767
Y-Yes!

120
00:07:03,967 --> 00:07:05,135
Is your company

121
00:07:05,635 --> 00:07:09,739
developing a game called "Campus Fairy Quest"?

122
00:07:10,073 --> 00:07:11,741
H-How do you know that?

123
00:07:11,941 --> 00:07:13,810
Because Ryo-chan likes games.

124
00:07:14,044 --> 00:07:16,413
Even in the industry, only a few know about it!

125
00:07:16,613 --> 00:07:21,317
I'll introduce you to the chief. Just let me have the prototype.

126
00:07:21,785 --> 00:07:24,054
I'm not sure about "Cam Fair".

127
00:07:24,254 --> 00:07:25,822
If you like games,

128
00:07:26,222 --> 00:07:28,825
how about a bugged version of "Nupupuya-san 2"?

129
00:07:29,225 --> 00:07:31,861
Oh, "Bug Nup"! Hmm...

130
00:07:32,095 --> 00:07:34,230
Then, how about "Omunage Police"?

131
00:07:34,431 --> 00:07:37,233
I got "Munapoli" before the pre-orders started.

132
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:38,835
How?!

133
00:07:39,302 --> 00:07:41,004
Okay, then, what about "Angel Hazard"?

134
00:07:41,237 --> 00:07:42,605
I have it. And I completed it.

135
00:07:42,806 --> 00:07:44,841
Huh? How about "Poyoyon Super"?

136
00:07:45,075 --> 00:07:46,609
I completed it and already lent it out!

137
00:07:46,810 --> 00:07:47,877
Why?

138
00:07:48,778 --> 00:07:50,547
Well, let's see,

139
00:07:50,947 --> 00:07:53,950
how about "Tekkenden Memorial Aquanaut Sports Festival"?

140
00:07:54,350 --> 00:07:55,685
Oh, that sounds great!

141
00:07:55,885 --> 00:07:57,487
Okay, leave it to me!

142
00:07:57,687 --> 00:07:59,556
I'll introduce you to the chief!

143
00:07:59,789 --> 00:08:00,623
Really?

144
00:08:01,091 --> 00:08:04,194
Sure! Just don't forget the game.

145
00:08:04,427 --> 00:08:05,028
Okay.

146
00:08:05,261 --> 00:08:06,863
Right, let's drink!

147
00:08:10,667 --> 00:08:13,203
"KAMEARI PARK POLICE STATION"

148
00:08:15,205 --> 00:08:15,839
Hmm?

149
00:08:16,039 --> 00:08:18,842
Hey, let's go to Australia on our honeymoon.

150
00:08:19,042 --> 00:08:20,109
Wherever you want.

151
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:21,544
I'm so happy!

152
00:08:22,278 --> 00:08:23,279
Wait for me!

153
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,447
Come on!

154
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,221
Here he comes. Ready?

155
00:08:31,454 --> 00:08:32,155
Y-Yes.

156
00:08:33,590 --> 00:08:34,457
Huh?

157
00:08:34,924 --> 00:08:36,126
What are you doing, Ryotsu?

158
00:08:36,493 --> 00:08:38,061
Sorry, Chief, but I had no choice.

159
00:08:38,294 --> 00:08:42,499
You're so stubborn, I had to do this just to make you listen.

160
00:08:42,699 --> 00:08:44,300
What? Oh...

161
00:08:45,935 --> 00:08:47,470
Hey, Kakuta, talk now!

162
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:49,839
F-Father, no, Ohara-san.

163
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:52,408
I don't know! I hear nothing!

164
00:08:52,775 --> 00:08:56,045
Chief, you're not a kid. Come on...

165
00:08:57,614 --> 00:08:59,382
I don't know!

166
00:09:01,317 --> 00:09:02,519
Ryotsu-san!

167
00:09:04,587 --> 00:09:06,189
O-Ohara-san... Oh!

168
00:09:06,389 --> 00:09:07,023
Chief!

169
00:09:07,423 --> 00:09:09,859
I don't know! I'm going on patrol!

170
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:11,761
Go after him! Don't lose him!

171
00:09:11,961 --> 00:09:12,595
Okay!

172
00:09:12,862 --> 00:09:16,566
Chief!

173
00:09:16,766 --> 00:09:20,036
Ohara-san, please listen to me!

174
00:09:20,737 --> 00:09:22,405
He's just like a spoiled brat.

175
00:09:22,605 --> 00:09:24,407
Right, if he wants to act like that...

176
00:09:32,815 --> 00:09:33,516
Got him!

177
00:09:33,716 --> 00:09:34,417
Father!

178
00:09:35,118 --> 00:09:35,952
Chief!

179
00:09:36,185 --> 00:09:37,453
Father!

180
00:09:37,787 --> 00:09:38,922
Chief!

181
00:09:44,193 --> 00:09:44,994
Grab my hand!

182
00:09:49,365 --> 00:09:50,800
Hold on until the next bus stop!

183
00:09:56,206 --> 00:09:58,241
Stop! Stop the bus!

184
00:10:00,643 --> 00:10:02,478
"KANAMACHI STATION"

185
00:10:15,925 --> 00:10:18,294
You're busted, Chief.

186
00:10:19,429 --> 00:10:20,964
I'm getting off!

187
00:10:21,164 --> 00:10:21,998
Wait!

188
00:10:22,232 --> 00:10:23,266
Ohara-san!

189
00:10:29,005 --> 00:10:30,340
Head straight for Tokyo Bay!

190
00:10:30,573 --> 00:10:31,441
Y-Yes.

191
00:10:33,276 --> 00:10:34,410
So long!

192
00:10:34,811 --> 00:10:37,347
Damn it! The enemy is heading for Tokyo Bay!

193
00:10:38,948 --> 00:10:40,149
Chief!

194
00:10:40,516 --> 00:10:43,853
Father! Please listen to me!

195
00:10:44,053 --> 00:10:45,888
Chief, I won't let you get away!

196
00:10:46,256 --> 00:10:48,658
Gah, what persistent guys!

197
00:10:56,199 --> 00:10:56,866
Take this!

198
00:10:57,066 --> 00:10:58,534
Ryotsu-san, it's a net!

199
00:11:01,337 --> 00:11:02,171
It's flooding!

200
00:11:02,372 --> 00:11:03,206
Bail it out!

201
00:11:05,475 --> 00:11:08,211
Captain, keep going to America!

202
00:11:08,444 --> 00:11:09,679
What? America?

203
00:11:12,482 --> 00:11:14,751
Damn it! You'll pay for this!

204
00:11:14,984 --> 00:11:16,619
Chief!

205
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:22,025
That sounds pretty rough.

206
00:11:22,225 --> 00:11:25,061
Jeez, that stubborn jerk.

207
00:11:26,929 --> 00:11:28,297
Here, Ryo-chan, have some tea.

208
00:11:28,498 --> 00:11:29,666
Oh, thanks.

209
00:11:29,866 --> 00:11:31,067
And what about Kakuta-san?

210
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:32,869
He went back to the office.

211
00:11:33,069 --> 00:11:33,870
I see.

212
00:11:34,203 --> 00:11:37,473
But he stuck with me to the end.

213
00:11:37,674 --> 00:11:39,075
He's got some guts.

214
00:11:39,676 --> 00:11:42,045
I'd like to do something to help him out.

215
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:45,581
So, what are you going to do now, Ryo-chan?

216
00:11:46,182 --> 00:11:49,752
Hmm. At this point, we have no choice but to leave the chief out of it.

217
00:11:49,952 --> 00:11:50,687
Huh?

218
00:11:50,887 --> 00:11:52,655
We'll do it ourselves!

219
00:11:52,855 --> 00:11:54,123
Just watch.

220
00:11:54,357 --> 00:11:59,796
We'll throw a wedding so grand, the chief will be floored!

221
00:12:12,742 --> 00:12:14,877
What? Without Dad?

222
00:12:15,345 --> 00:12:16,612
But then...

223
00:12:16,813 --> 00:12:20,817
Look, with the chief, nothing will come together.

224
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:24,087
If we wait for his blessing, it could take years.

225
00:12:24,821 --> 00:12:26,055
But...

226
00:12:28,558 --> 00:12:30,993
You're right. That might be a good idea.

227
00:12:31,227 --> 00:12:32,128
Mom!

228
00:12:32,695 --> 00:12:35,565
I'm sure your father will forgive you.

229
00:12:35,765 --> 00:12:39,368
Whatever he says, he's just sad his little girl is getting married.

230
00:12:39,969 --> 00:12:42,238
Ryotsu-san, thank you for suggesting that.

231
00:12:42,438 --> 00:12:44,307
Let's make him make up his mind.

232
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:46,275
Please go ahead and move things forward.

233
00:12:46,476 --> 00:12:50,480
Leave it to me! I'll get the ball rolling, fast and steady!

234
00:12:56,853 --> 00:13:00,390
Oh, no. Have you also been swimming in Tokyo Bay?

235
00:13:00,590 --> 00:13:01,190
What?

236
00:13:02,925 --> 00:13:03,793
Dear.

237
00:13:03,993 --> 00:13:04,761
What is it?

238
00:13:04,961 --> 00:13:06,462
It's about Hiromi.

239
00:13:08,164 --> 00:13:09,866
Why not give them your blessing?

240
00:13:11,968 --> 00:13:15,204
You know that Kakuta-san is an impeccable young man, don't you?

241
00:13:15,438 --> 00:13:18,307
I don't know. I don't want to hear about that guy!

242
00:13:19,509 --> 00:13:22,445
Then, please meet him once instead!

243
00:13:22,645 --> 00:13:23,279
What?

244
00:13:23,679 --> 00:13:27,350
Meet him properly, talk to him, and then make your decision!

245
00:13:28,618 --> 00:13:29,452
Dear!

246
00:13:32,355 --> 00:13:37,059
If you don't meet him now, we'll proceed with the wedding on our own!

247
00:13:37,293 --> 00:13:39,629
Huh, what? By what right...

248
00:13:39,829 --> 00:13:41,631
It's my right!

249
00:13:41,831 --> 00:13:43,433
I'm Hiromi's mother!

250
00:13:43,966 --> 00:13:46,435
Do you think you've raised her all by yourself?

251
00:13:46,636 --> 00:13:49,672
No, no. I didn't mean to...

252
00:13:49,872 --> 00:13:52,542
So, you'll meet him then?

253
00:13:53,609 --> 00:13:54,443
No, I won't!

254
00:13:54,644 --> 00:13:57,914
I won't meet some guy I know nothing about!

255
00:13:58,848 --> 00:14:02,318
I'll never approve it! If you're going to do it, then do it!

256
00:14:02,518 --> 00:14:03,386
Wait!

257
00:14:03,853 --> 00:14:06,389
Oh, what a stubborn man.

258
00:14:07,356 --> 00:14:10,526
Hmph! How can she say "my right"?

259
00:14:10,726 --> 00:14:12,395
Who does she think she's living off of?

260
00:14:13,229 --> 00:14:14,697
Do whatever you want!

261
00:14:15,465 --> 00:14:17,266
What? Fully booked?

262
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:20,236
I really want to do it in a week.

263
00:14:20,703 --> 00:14:24,273
What? That's enough! I'll never ask you again!

264
00:14:25,641 --> 00:14:27,710
Damn. Where's next?

265
00:14:29,812 --> 00:14:31,848
Hey, are there any more phones?

266
00:14:33,816 --> 00:14:36,018
Hmm? Yeah, perfect!

267
00:14:36,385 --> 00:14:39,188
I never thought Ryo-chan would try so hard.

268
00:14:39,388 --> 00:14:40,223
You're right.

269
00:14:40,423 --> 00:14:42,592
It's a matter of pride now!

270
00:14:43,893 --> 00:14:47,363
Oh, maybe that guy can help...

271
00:14:48,297 --> 00:14:50,533
Yes, this is Asakusa Kameunkaku.

272
00:14:51,734 --> 00:14:54,604
The chairman? Just a moment, please.

273
00:14:55,371 --> 00:14:58,407
Oh, Ryo-chan, it's been a while.

274
00:14:58,674 --> 00:15:01,277
What? You want to use our hotel that's opening soon?

275
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:04,280
Ryo-chan, that's way too sudden...

276
00:15:04,514 --> 00:15:06,249
It's still a week before the opening?

277
00:15:06,449 --> 00:15:08,518
That's fine as long as the venue is ready.

278
00:15:08,718 --> 00:15:11,420
B-But the interior's still under construction...

279
00:15:11,621 --> 00:15:13,723
Huh? On February 1st, four years ago,

280
00:15:13,923 --> 00:15:18,394
who took you home when you got drunk and fell asleep on the street?

281
00:15:18,794 --> 00:15:22,565
Who bailed you out when you got busted for peeing in public?

282
00:15:22,932 --> 00:15:27,470
Do you want me to tell your wife about all that sneaky stuff you did?

283
00:15:27,703 --> 00:15:28,804
O-Okay.

284
00:15:29,105 --> 00:15:30,740
Hey, I'm not asking for it for free.

285
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:33,276
I'll build you a D51 of Kinshodo in return.

286
00:15:33,476 --> 00:15:35,177
I'm counting on you, got it?

287
00:15:35,811 --> 00:15:37,880
See that? I got the venue!

288
00:15:39,415 --> 00:15:41,284
I felt a little sorry for him, though.

289
00:15:41,484 --> 00:15:43,352
Hey, it's all about give and take.

290
00:15:43,586 --> 00:15:45,021
Ryotsu!

291
00:15:46,555 --> 00:15:49,358
You! What are you doing during work hours?

292
00:15:50,359 --> 00:15:54,096
Heh, too bad for you! I just finished my night shift and I'm off now.

293
00:15:54,297 --> 00:15:56,799
Then, go home already! Jeez...

294
00:15:57,266 --> 00:16:00,269
Oh, Chief. Before I go, let me tell you something.

295
00:16:00,469 --> 00:16:03,839
The wedding venue and date are all set now, so keep that in mind.

296
00:16:04,173 --> 00:16:07,577
I bet Hiromi-san will look stunning in her wedding dress.

297
00:16:07,777 --> 00:16:10,646
Don't make things worse!

298
00:16:12,815 --> 00:16:15,851
"KAMEUNKAKU WEDDING HALL"

299
00:16:23,292 --> 00:16:24,594
"KATSUSHIKA POLICE HEADQUARTERS"

300
00:16:40,776 --> 00:16:42,945
Honey, just try this on...

301
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:45,348
Oh?

302
00:17:03,899 --> 00:17:04,734
&lt;i&gt;Daddy!&lt;/i&gt;

303
00:17:04,967 --> 00:17:05,701
Oh!

304
00:17:26,889 --> 00:17:28,524
It's okay, Hiromi.

305
00:17:28,991 --> 00:17:31,560
I'm sure your father will come.

306
00:17:32,294 --> 00:17:33,229
But...

307
00:17:33,596 --> 00:17:35,131
Don't worry.

308
00:17:35,364 --> 00:17:38,200
He just loves you so much.

309
00:17:44,106 --> 00:17:45,374
-Honey! -Dad!

310
00:17:46,776 --> 00:17:48,544
Oh my God! He's so hot!

311
00:17:48,744 --> 00:17:51,013
Hiromi, call the doctor!

312
00:17:51,213 --> 00:17:52,048
Hiromi!

313
00:17:52,248 --> 00:17:53,115
Y-Yes!

314
00:17:56,018 --> 00:17:59,789
Anyway, please keep him warm and let him sleep well today.

315
00:18:00,022 --> 00:18:00,756
Well then.

316
00:18:00,956 --> 00:18:02,792
Thank you very much.

317
00:18:12,735 --> 00:18:15,237
Hiromi, you go to bed now.

318
00:18:15,438 --> 00:18:16,972
Tomorrow is an important day.

319
00:18:17,173 --> 00:18:18,908
It's okay. Let me do it.

320
00:18:19,108 --> 00:18:20,976
You should go to bed first.

321
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:23,446
It's my fault.

322
00:18:23,646 --> 00:18:25,414
Because of me,

323
00:18:25,614 --> 00:18:27,983
Dad hasn't been sleeping well at night.

324
00:18:28,184 --> 00:18:29,318
But you...

325
00:18:29,652 --> 00:18:32,588
Please. I only have today.

326
00:18:32,788 --> 00:18:36,158
Until our wedding tomorrow, I want to be the Oharas' daughter,

327
00:18:36,492 --> 00:18:38,461
Dad's child.

328
00:18:39,328 --> 00:18:40,162
Hiromi.

329
00:18:44,734 --> 00:18:45,634
&lt;i&gt;Hiromi!&lt;/i&gt;

330
00:18:46,202 --> 00:18:49,538
&lt;i&gt;N-No! I won't allow you&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;to get married yet!&lt;/i&gt;

331
00:18:49,772 --> 00:18:51,073
&lt;i&gt;Hiromi!&lt;/i&gt;

332
00:18:53,075 --> 00:18:54,510
Ugh... no!

333
00:19:12,361 --> 00:19:14,964
Thank goodness! His fever's gone.

334
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:18,801
Dad...

335
00:19:20,169 --> 00:19:23,305
Dad, thank you for all these years.

336
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:27,409
I'm marrying Hideo-san today.

337
00:19:27,943 --> 00:19:30,980
I wanted you to be happy more than anyone else.

338
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,783
But I guess it's my fault.

339
00:19:34,383 --> 00:19:38,053
I should have thought about you more.

340
00:19:41,824 --> 00:19:42,424
Hiromi.

341
00:19:42,658 --> 00:19:44,059
Hiromi-san, it's about time.

342
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:47,830
Come on! Don't worry about your dad.

343
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:50,900
I'll come back here right after the ceremony.

344
00:19:51,133 --> 00:19:53,435
The ceremony starts at 12 o'clock. Hurry, hurry...

345
00:19:53,669 --> 00:19:54,570
Okay.

346
00:20:02,545 --> 00:20:04,146
"KAMEUNKAKU WEDDING HALL"

347
00:20:08,751 --> 00:20:09,852
The chief isn't coming.

348
00:20:10,052 --> 00:20:12,755
He's down with a cold. There's no way he can come.

349
00:20:19,094 --> 00:20:21,030
"I MADE PORRIDGE. WARM IT UP TO EAT. HIROMI"

350
00:20:24,266 --> 00:20:25,434
Hiromi!

351
00:20:25,868 --> 00:20:29,605
&lt;i&gt;I should have thought about you more.&lt;/i&gt;

352
00:20:31,574 --> 00:20:33,309
I, I...

353
00:20:34,210 --> 00:20:36,612
&lt;i&gt;Uh-oh, looks like I've caught a cold. I'm going to bed.&lt;/i&gt;

354
00:20:36,845 --> 00:20:37,713
&lt;i&gt;Dad!&lt;/i&gt;

355
00:20:38,013 --> 00:20:40,716
&lt;i&gt;I can't. I still have work to do.&lt;/i&gt;

356
00:20:41,250 --> 00:20:45,721
I was being stubborn and didn't even consider Hiromi's feelings...

357
00:20:46,322 --> 00:20:47,323
&lt;i&gt;Daddy!&lt;/i&gt;

358
00:20:48,958 --> 00:20:51,026
&lt;i&gt;Hiromi, are you here to pick me up?&lt;/i&gt;

359
00:20:51,227 --> 00:20:51,861
&lt;i&gt;Yeah!&lt;/i&gt;

360
00:20:52,294 --> 00:20:54,863
&lt;i&gt;What do you want to be&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;when you grow up, Hiromi?&lt;/i&gt;

361
00:20:55,064 --> 00:20:56,599
&lt;i&gt;Daddy's bride!&lt;/i&gt;

362
00:20:56,799 --> 00:20:59,735
&lt;i&gt;I see! My bride, huh?&lt;/i&gt;

363
00:21:01,337 --> 00:21:03,105
&lt;i&gt;You want to go to the police academy?&lt;/i&gt;

364
00:21:03,405 --> 00:21:07,610
&lt;i&gt;No way! I can't let you take on&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;such a tough job!&lt;/i&gt;

365
00:21:07,810 --> 00:21:09,678
&lt;i&gt;You need to go to college properly!&lt;/i&gt;

366
00:21:09,912 --> 00:21:10,880
&lt;i&gt;Hmm...&lt;/i&gt;

367
00:21:12,214 --> 00:21:14,083
&lt;i&gt;You got a boyfriend?&lt;/i&gt;

368
00:21:22,691 --> 00:21:24,760
You look beautiful, Hiromi.

369
00:21:26,128 --> 00:21:28,063
It's time to start.

370
00:21:28,697 --> 00:21:31,967
Could you wait just five more minutes?

371
00:21:37,273 --> 00:21:38,507
&lt;i&gt;Daddy!&lt;/i&gt;

372
00:21:39,074 --> 00:21:48,651
Hiromi!

373
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:58,794
Hiromi-chan.

374
00:21:58,994 --> 00:21:59,628
Huh?

375
00:22:00,095 --> 00:22:02,665
Let's do our best to make your father happy.

376
00:22:04,199 --> 00:22:04,867
Yes.

377
00:22:05,401 --> 00:22:07,970
Kameunkaku in Asakusa. And hurry!

378
00:22:08,170 --> 00:22:11,473
Well, I've known Kakuta-kun since elementary school.

379
00:22:12,341 --> 00:22:14,810
As a student, he was very...

380
00:22:26,855 --> 00:22:28,057
Let's be happy.

381
00:22:29,158 --> 00:22:29,992
Yes.

382
00:22:30,359 --> 00:22:32,895
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss...

383
00:22:33,395 --> 00:22:34,964
Wait!

384
00:22:38,167 --> 00:22:39,201
Dad!

385
00:22:39,401 --> 00:22:40,703
Oh no! Nakagawa, stop him!

386
00:22:40,903 --> 00:22:41,904
H-Huh?

387
00:22:42,137 --> 00:22:43,405
Ch-Chief, how are you feeling?

388
00:22:44,039 --> 00:22:44,873
Chief!

389
00:22:45,074 --> 00:22:45,908
Shut up!

390
00:22:47,609 --> 00:22:50,012
Everyone! I'm the father of the bride!

391
00:22:50,212 --> 00:22:52,448
I was...

392
00:22:55,351 --> 00:22:56,719
against this marriage.

393
00:22:57,252 --> 00:22:59,355
Without thinking of Hiromi's sadness,

394
00:22:59,555 --> 00:23:01,790
I've been avoiding Kakuta-kun.

395
00:23:02,257 --> 00:23:04,793
If my subordinates hadn't gone ahead with the ceremony,

396
00:23:05,027 --> 00:23:06,428
I, I...

397
00:23:07,062 --> 00:23:09,465
I would have regretted it for the rest of my life.

398
00:23:09,698 --> 00:23:11,533
Thank you everyone for today.

399
00:23:11,734 --> 00:23:14,103
And I'm sorry, Kakuta-kun.

400
00:23:16,205 --> 00:23:18,040
Ohar... Father.

401
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:22,111
Hideo-kun, please take good care of Hiromi, my daughter!

402
00:23:22,344 --> 00:23:24,113
Y-Yes, sir! You can count on me!

403
00:23:26,915 --> 00:23:29,284
Okay, I'll take a photo. Smile!

404
00:23:29,485 --> 00:23:31,787
Say cheese!

405
00:23:37,726 --> 00:23:39,128
Well, it was a great ceremony!

406
00:23:39,361 --> 00:23:42,297
All right, Ryotsu, Let's go to another bar! One more!

407
00:23:42,498 --> 00:23:45,968
Chief, let's call it a night. Don't you have a cold?

408
00:23:46,201 --> 00:23:49,505
What? I'll make you write a report!

409
00:23:49,738 --> 00:23:51,607
-Come on! -Fine, let's go.

410
00:23:51,807 --> 00:23:53,242
10 bars or even 20!

411
00:23:53,442 --> 00:23:55,110
That's the spirit!

412
00:24:03,085 --> 00:24:08,857
RECOVER THE SECRET PHOTOS!
